# Originality and monetization

Need `originality_score ≥ 80` vs the last 10 videos **on the same channel** and `ready_to_publish` before emitting `flow_prompts` (`python -m channel qa`, `scripts/lint_originality.py`).

Brand consistency is not repetition. A name-swap spine is. Do not clone Visa's four desks onto Costco or Nvidia's CUDA story onto Rolex.

`the_thought` must be spoken. No “was born” / “was founded” cold opens.

Do not emit `flow_prompts` or ingest Google Flow stills if QA fails. Report the flags; do not lower the threshold.
